{"sections":[{"slug":"充实范畴","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"充实范畴"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">充实范畴</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"充实范畴"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">观念</span></h2>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">充实范畴</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">是范畴的推广</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">其对象之间的</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">态射集</span>” <span lang=\"zh\">不是集合</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">而是更一般的幺半范畴的对象</span>.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>$n$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴可视为充实于</span> $(n-1)$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴的范畴</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">这里</span>, $n$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴指的是</span> $(\\infty,n)$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span>.</li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">充实于</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/生象","text":"$\\mathsf{Ani}$"}},{"Plain":" <span lang=\"zh\">的范畴就是</span> $(\\infty ,1)$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span>.</li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">充实于</span> $k$-<span lang=\"zh\">模谱范畴</span> $\\mathsf{Vect}_k$ <span lang=\"zh\">的范畴即是</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/微分分次范畴","text":"DG <span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":".</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">传统</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $\\mathcal{V}$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/幺半范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">幺半范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">定义</span> $\\mathcal{V}$-<span lang=\"zh\">充实范畴</span> $\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">为如下结构</span>: <span lang=\"zh\">一族对象</span> $\\operatorname{ob}(\\mathcal C)$, <span lang=\"zh\">每两个对象之间有一个态射对象</span> $\\operatorname{Hom}(x,y)\\in\\operatorname{ob}(\\mathcal{V})$, <span lang=\"zh\">每三个对象之间有一个复合态射</span>\n$$\r\n\\circ\\colon \\operatorname{Hom}(y,z)\\otimes \\operatorname{Hom}(x,y) \\to \\operatorname{Hom}(x,z).\r\n$$</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">使用代数胚</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">充实范畴是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/结合代数","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">结合代数</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的推广</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">是一种</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/代数胚","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">代数胚</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p>…</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">参考</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/GepnerHaugsengEnrichedCategories","text":"Gepner–Haugseng"}},{"Plain":", "},{"Local":{"url":"/HinichYonedaEnriched","text":"Hinich"}},{"Plain":", "},{"Local":{"url":"/StefanichHigherQCoh","text":"Stefanich"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">充实用范畴的更换</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $F \\colon \\mathcal V \\to \\mathcal V'$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/松幺半函子","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">松幺半函子</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">则由</span> $\\mathcal V$-<span lang=\"zh\">充实范畴</span> $\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">可得</span> $\\mathcal V'$-<span lang=\"zh\">充实范畴</span> $\\mathcal C'$, <span lang=\"zh\">其中</span>\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C'}(X,Y) = F(\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(X,Y)).\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">特别地</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">松幺半函子</span> $F\\colon \\mathcal V\\to\\mathcal V'$ <span lang=\"zh\">将</span> $\\mathcal V$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/结合代数","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">结合代数</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">变为</span> $\\mathcal V'$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的结合代数</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">假设函子</span> $\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal V}(1_{\\mathcal V},-) \\colon \\mathcal V \\to \\mathsf{Set}$ <span lang=\"zh\">是松幺半的</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">那么</span> $\\mathcal V$-<span lang=\"zh\">充实范畴可变为普通范畴</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">这个普通范畴有时称为其底层范畴</span>.</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">充实范畴的张量积</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $\\mathcal V$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/幺半范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">幺半范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">则对于</span> $\\mathcal V$-<span lang=\"zh\">充实范畴</span> $\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B$, <span lang=\"zh\">可定义</span> $\\mathcal V$-<span lang=\"zh\">充实范畴</span> $\\mathcal A\\otimes\\mathcal B$, <span lang=\"zh\">其对象为</span> $(a,b)$, $a\\in\\mathcal A$, $b\\in\\mathcal B$; <span lang=\"zh\">态射为</span>\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal A\\otimes \\mathcal B}((a,b),(a',b')) := \\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal A}(a,a')\\otimes\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal B}(b,b').\r\n$$</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">充实范畴上的模</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">当</span> $\\mathcal V$ <span lang=\"zh\">为余完备</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/闭范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">闭</span>"}},{"Local":{"url":"/对称幺半范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">对称幺半范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">时</span>, $\\mathcal V$-<span lang=\"zh\">充实范畴上可定义左模</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">右模</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">双模</span>, "},{"Local":{"url":"/Morita等价","text":"Morita <span lang=\"zh\">等价</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">等等概念</span>; <span lang=\"zh\">见</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/充实范畴上的模","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">充实范畴上的模</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">与模的关系</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">参考</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/StefanichHigherQCoh","text":"Stefanich"}},{"Plain":" <span lang=\"zh\">第</span> 4 <span lang=\"zh\">章</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $\\mathcal V$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/可表现范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">可表现</span>"}},{"Local":{"url":"/对称幺半范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">对称幺半范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">则</span> $\\mathsf{Pr}$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的</span> $\\mathcal V$-<span lang=\"zh\">模</span> $\\mathcal A$ <span lang=\"zh\">可视为</span> $\\mathcal V$-<span lang=\"zh\">充实范畴</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">满足</span>\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal A}(v\\otimes a,a')\\simeq\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal V}(v,\\operatorname{Hom}(a,a')).\r\n$$</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">另一方面</span>, $\\mathcal V$-<span lang=\"zh\">充实范畴也可自由地生成</span> $\\mathcal V$-<span lang=\"zh\">模</span>: <span lang=\"zh\">对于</span> $\\mathcal V$-<span lang=\"zh\">充实范畴</span> $\\mathcal A$, <span lang=\"zh\">其上的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/预层","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">预层</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的范畴</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">也即</span> $\\mathcal A$-"},{"Local":{"url":"/充实范畴上的模","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">右模</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的范畴</span> $\\mathsf{Fun}(\\mathcal A^{\\mathrm{op}},\\mathcal V)$ <span lang=\"zh\">是其自由生成的</span> $\\mathcal V$-<span lang=\"zh\">模</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">相关概念</span></h2>\n"}]}}}]}